== start
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  46 134 222
  sliders 46/255 134/255 222/255
  hex     #2E86DE   well #2E86DE   swatch #2E86DE
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
  harmony Complement: #DE862E
  harmony Analog −30°: #2EDEDE
  harmony Analog +30°: #2E2EDE
  harmony Triad +120°: #DE2E86
  harmony Triad +240°: #86DE2E
== drag Red to 230, Green to 90
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  230 90 222
  sliders 230/255 90/255 222/255
  hex     #E65ADE   well #E65ADE   swatch #E65ADE
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== type 40 in Blue, Return
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  230 90 40
  sliders 230/255 90/255 40/255
  hex     #E65A28   well #E65A28   swatch #E65A28
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== type 300 in Green (applied live, clamped; the field keeps what was typed)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  230 300 40
  sliders 230/255 255/255 40/255
  hex     #E6FF28   well #E6FF28   swatch #E6FF28
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== press Return in Green (the field shows the clamped value)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  230 255 40
  sliders 230/255 255/255 40/255
  hex     #E6FF28   well #E6FF28   swatch #E6FF28
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== type 1, 2, x in Red (1 and 12 applied live, 12x rejected)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  12x 255 40
  sliders 12/255 255/255 40/255
  hex     #0CFF28   well #0CFF28   swatch #0CFF28
  status  Type a whole number for Red.   (systemRedColor)
== clear Red to retype it (no complaint while it is empty)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  (empty) 255 40
  sliders 12/255 255/255 40/255
  hex     #0CFF28   well #0CFF28   swatch #0CFF28
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== type 230 in Red, Return
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  230 255 40
  sliders 230/255 255/255 40/255
  hex     #E6FF28   well #E6FF28   swatch #E6FF28
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== type #3cb371 in Hex
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  60 179 113
  sliders 60/255 179/255 113/255
  hex     #3CB371   well #3CB371   swatch #3CB371
  status  Set #3CB371.   (systemGrayColor)
  harmony Complement: #B33C7E
  harmony Analog −30°: #43B33C
  harmony Analog +30°: #3CB3AD
  harmony Triad +120°: #713CB3
  harmony Triad +240°: #B3713C
== type #12345 in Hex (rejected)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  60 179 113
  sliders 60/255 179/255 113/255
  hex     #12345   well #3CB371   swatch #3CB371
  status  “#12345” is not a hex color: use #RRGGBB or #RGB.   (systemRedColor)
== type f80 in Hex (short form)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  255 136 0
  sliders 255/255 136/255 0/255
  hex     #FF8800   well #FF8800   swatch #FF8800
  status  Set #FF8800.   (systemGrayColor)
== switch to HSB
  mode    HSB   menu [ ] RGB Sliders  [x] HSB Sliders
  names   Hue Saturation Brightness
  fields  32° 100% 100%
  sliders 32/360 100/100 100/100
  hex     #FF8800   well #FF8800   swatch #FF8800
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
