== Color > RGB Sliders, Color > Use Complement
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  204 153 51
  sliders 204/255 153/255 51/255
  hex     #CC9933   well #CC9933   swatch #CC9933
  status  Now using the Complement #CC9933.   (systemGrayColor)
