  mode    HSB   menu [ ] RGB Sliders  [x] HSB Sliders
  names   Hue Saturation Brightness
  fields  220° 75% 80%
  sliders 220/360 75/100 80/100
  hex     #3366CC   well #3366CC   swatch #3366CC
