== press ⌘1 (Color > RGB Sliders)
  mode    RGB   menu [x] RGB Sliders  [ ] HSB Sliders
  names   Red Green Blue
  fields  51 102 204
  sliders 51/255 102/255 204/255
  hex     #3366CC   well #3366CC   swatch #3366CC
  status  Drag a slider, type a value or a hex color, or click a harmony swatch.   (systemGrayColor)
== click Copy Hex
  clipboard #3366CC
  status    Copied #3366CC to the clipboard.
== put other text on the clipboard, press ⇧⌘C (Color > Copy Hex)
  clipboard #3366CC
  status    Copied #3366CC to the clipboard.
